{"id": "r02", "symbol": "RELIANCE", "type": "reasoning", "question": "What drove the year-on-year increase in Reliance's O2C segment EBITDA in Q2 FY27?", "gold_answer": "EBITDA up 67.9% YoY to ₹25,203 crore, driven by unprecedented strength in transportation fuel cracks (up 3-3.7x YoY, historic highs) and improved downstream chemical margins; polyester chain margins also recovered", "must_include": ["crack"], "answerable": true, "gold": [{"path": "data\\raw\\RELIANCE\\results\\2026-10-30_in-continuation-of-our-letter-of-today-s-date-on-the-unaudit_405df432.pdf", "page": 3}, {"path": "data\\raw\\RELIANCE\\results\\2026-10-30_in-continuation-of-our-letter-of-today-s-date-on-the-unaudit_405df432.pdf", "page": 5}, {"path": "data\\raw\\RELIANCE\\results\\2026-10-30_in-continuation-of-our-letter-of-today-s-date-on-the-unaudit_405df432.pdf", "page": 14}, {"path": "data\\raw\\RELIANCE\\results\\2026-10-30_please-find-attached-presentation-on-the-unaudited-financial_ca827d11.pdf", "page": 6}, {"path": "data\\raw\\RELIANCE\\results\\2026-10-30_please-find-attached-presentation-on-the-unaudited-financial_ca827d11.pdf", "page": 11}, {"path": "data\\raw\\RELIANCE\\results\\2026-10-30_please-find-attached-presentation-on-the-unaudited-financial_ca827d11.pdf", "page": 48}, {"path": "data\\raw\\RELIANCE\\concall\\2026-11-01_transcript-of-the-discussion-on-the-unaudited-financial-resu_7e73536b.pdf", "page": 3}, {"path": "data\\raw\\RELIANCE\\concall\\2026-11-01_transcript-of-the-discussion-on-the-unaudited-financial-resu_7e73536b.pdf", "page": 4}, {"path": "data\\raw\\RELIANCE\\concall\\2026-11-01_transcript-of-the-discussion-on-the-unaudited-financial-resu_7e73536b.pdf", "page": 15}], "evidence": ["fuel cracks", "cracks", "tight fuel"], "drafted_by": "claude", "checked": "rendered-page+review"}
{"id": "s02", "symbol": "SUZLON", "type": "reasoning", "question": "Why did Suzlon's WTG contribution margin decline year-on-year in Q2 FY27?", "gold_answer": "WTG contribution margin fell from 26.9% to 21.2%, primarily due to segment/customer and scope mix changes, with FX and commodity volatility (largely the West Asia crisis, about 50 bps) as a secondary factor. The ~₹50 crore non-recurring Suzlon 2.0 opex (~1% impact) hit EBITDA margin, not contribution margin.", "must_include": ["mix"], "answerable": true, "gold": [{"path": "data\\raw\\SUZLON\\concall\\2026-11-04_q2-fy27-earning-conference-call_1e238c1c.pdf", "page": 5}, {"path": "data\\raw\\SUZLON\\concall\\2026-11-04_q2-fy27-earning-conference-call_1e238c1c.pdf", "page": 6}, {"path": "data\\raw\\SUZLON\\concall\\2026-11-04_q2-fy27-earning-conference-call_1e238c1c.pdf", "page": 9}, {"path": "data\\raw\\SUZLON\\results\\2026-10-29_outcome-of-the-board-meeting-dated-29th-october-2026_f0b89e38.pdf", "page": 48}], "evidence": ["scope mix", "26.9%", "West Asia", "commodity"], "drafted_by": "claude", "checked": "rendered-page+review"}
{"id": "v03", "symbol": "IDEA", "type": "reasoning", "question": "Why did the Government of India become a shareholder of Vodafone Idea in February 2023?", "gold_answer": "Under the September 2021 telecom Reforms and Support Package, Vodafone Idea opted to convert the interest arising from deferment of spectrum instalments and AGR dues into equity; on 3 Feb 2023 the Ministry of Communications ordered it to issue equity shares against the Rs. 161.33 billion loan representing the NPV of that interest (16.13 billion shares at Rs. 10), making GoI a ~33% shareholder.", "must_include": ["AGR", "interest"], "answerable": true, "gold": [{"path": "data\\raw\\IDEA\\results\\2023-05-25_the-company-has-informed-the-exchange-regarding-the-audited_6e584ae9.pdf", "page": 23}, {"path": "data\\raw\\IDEA\\results\\2023-05-25_the-company-has-informed-the-exchange-regarding-the-audited_6e584ae9.pdf", "page": 24}, {"path": "data\\raw\\IDEA\\results\\2023-05-25_the-company-has-informed-the-exchange-regarding-the-audited_6e584ae9.pdf", "page": 25}, {"path": "data\\raw\\IDEA\\results\\2023-05-25_the-company-has-informed-the-exchange-regarding-the-audited_e976dac0.pdf", "page": 23}, {"path": "data\\raw\\IDEA\\results\\2023-05-25_the-company-has-informed-the-exchange-regarding-the-audited_e976dac0.pdf", "page": 24}, {"path": "data\\raw\\IDEA\\results\\2023-05-25_the-company-has-informed-the-exchange-regarding-the-audited_e976dac0.pdf", "page": 25}, {"path": "data\\raw\\IDEA\\concall\\2023-06-02_transcript-of-the-analyst-investors-call-held-on-26-may-2023_06974cd3.pdf", "page": 3}, {"path": "data\\raw\\IDEA\\concall\\2023-06-02_transcript-of-the-analyst-investors-call-held-on-26-may-2023_06974cd3.pdf", "page": 9}, {"path": "data\\raw\\IDEA\\concall\\2023-06-02_transcript-of-the-analyst-investors-call-held-on-26-may-2023_06974cd3.pdf", "page": 22}, {"path": "data\\raw\\IDEA\\results\\2023-10-26_board-of-directors-at-their-meeting-held-on-26-october-2023_b940add0.pdf", "page": 6}, {"path": "dat